gl5|n|That which joins or links two things together; a bond or tie; a coupler. ; Two of the same kind connected or considered together; a pair; a brace. ; A male and female associated together; esp., a man and woman who are married or betrothed. ; See Couple-close. ; One of the pairs of plates of two metals which compose a voltaic battery; -- called a voltaic couple or galvanic couple. ; Two rotations, movements, etc., which are equal in amount but opposite in direction, and acting along parallel lines or around parallel axes.	a:1hxq,42,16;1684,33,21;1di6,25,10;sjm,21,36~sjm,21,36;1684,33,21;1hxq,42,16;1di6,25,10	V:1ume,30,2~1ume,30,2	N:1anx,60,6;11d5,36,1;2a9a,33,5;1atg,26,3;16eq,25,12;zcl,24,6;2bj5,21,9;244n,14,4;177e,6,2;i9y,3,1~16eq,25,12;2bj5,21,9;1anx,60,6;zcl,24,6;2a9a,33,5;244n,14,4;1atg,26,3;177e,6,2;11d5,36,1;i9y,3,1
